          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP314 Kinnaird Park

Posted: N 53° 33.409 W 113° 27.164

My GPSr: N 53° 33.409 W 113° 27.160&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GeoGuider and I met up with Team WillowZilla today to do some brass caps. We brought along a bag full of tools. Tim brought along a long screw driver that BVPete left behind at a brass cap somewhere along the way. The brush did the cleaning on a cap in good condition. Thanks for the cap outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
